    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "A page layout panel is typically displayed in response to the user selecting the Page Setup menu item.",
      "ko": "페이지 레이아웃 패널은 사용자가 Page Setup 메뉴 항목을 선택할 때 일반적으로 표시됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c16229c1dae1b008baa0f653e95e7f35865041244ede4473ffb51c3f7b4b97c0",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "You obtain an instance with the [`pageLayout`](nspagelayout/pagelayout.md) class method.",
      "ko": "[`pageLayout`](nspagelayout/pagelayout.md) 클래스 메서드로 인스턴스를 가져옵니다.",
      "sourceHash": "12d9ca09a73992404e70cc627da629ed2407c07633e7897210f7315cdbb055b8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0003",
      "source": "The pane can then be run as a sheet using [`beginSheet(with:modalFor:delegate:didEnd:contextInfo:)`](nspagelayout/beginsheet(with:modalfor:delegate:didend:contextinfo:).md) or modally using [`runModal()`](nspagelayout/runmodal().md) or [`runModal(with:)`](nspagelayout/runmodal(with:).md).",
      "ko": "그런 다음 [`beginSheet(with:modalFor:delegate:didEnd:contextInfo:)`](nspagelayout/beginsheet(with:modalfor:delegate:didend:contextinfo:).md)로 시트처럼 실행하거나, [`runModal()`](nspagelayout/runmodal().md) 또는 [`runModal(with:)`](nspagelayout/runmodal(with:).md)로 모달로 실행할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "5ec57e3273925a6b4c297d319924622f032fa30ef2a64bf7cadbdcc6c134ce33",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "For design guidance, see [`Human Interface Guidelines`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/macos/system-capabilities/printing#page-setup-dialogs).",
      "ko": "디자인 가이드는 [`Human Interface Guidelines`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/design/human-interface-guidelines/macos/system-capabilities/printing#page-setup-dialogs)를 참조하십시오.",
      "sourceHash": "83147e7fa83c4dc593024104f08fbddbb82fa79f841d4963134f1d25f57e3533",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
